  generalize NLogN.zsz (min 0 (piBits (2 * n + 10) * j / k - σ * log2Bits (2 * n + 10))) = A at hb hX
  generalize ((-(min 0 (piBits (2 * n + 10) * j / k - σ * log2Bits (2 * n + 10)))) /
